cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this GitHub Action, please cite it as below."
title: "prml-verify-action: GitHub Action for PRML manifest verification in CI"
abstract: >-
  A composite GitHub Action that verifies Pre-Registered ML Manifest (PRML)
  v0.1 hashes in continuous integration. Three modes: guard (verify hash
  against committed file), verdict (also check threshold against eval
  result), lock (refuse PRs that modify a committed manifest). Wraps the
  falsify CLI from PyPI; no Docker dependency.
